Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.91,0:00:02.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那是被封印的力量！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.50,0:00:06.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你体内被封印的黑暗之力\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.13,0:00:08.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,正在觉醒！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.75,0:00:12.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,既然这样 那莉露要用这股力量\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.51,0:00:15.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,去帮助村子里的大家！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.60,0:00:22.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露 这力量你得保密才行\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.19,0:00:25.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.61,0:00:31.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,秘密的力量\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.90,0:00:33.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,才更帅气不是吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:35.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,确实！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.99,0:00:39.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我还有一点工作要处理\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.54,0:00:42.12,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.38,0:00:50.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（29岁单身中坚冒险者的日常）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.42,0:00:51.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,往那边跑了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.63,0:00:52.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,从后面包抄！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.09,0:00:54.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,知道了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.38,0:00:56.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,忙得很啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.39,0:00:58.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不过\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.05,0:01:00.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这也是没办法的事\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.91,0:01:25.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.22,0:01:41.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你这小鬼！给我站住！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.15,0:01:54.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你们几个怎么可能抓得到我\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.86,0:01:58.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 肚子好饿\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.70,0:02:01.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 又出去闹事了吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.08,0:02:05.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,里奇！布比！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.87,0:02:10.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（第12话 故乡和伙伴）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.04,0:02:12.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 这可不行啊阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.34,0:02:16.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就是啊！要闹事的时候叫上我们啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.55,0:02:18.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉抱歉\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.93,0:02:20.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.22,0:02:24.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,老鼠肉烤好了哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.35,0:02:26.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.14,0:02:30.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,喂！你吃太多了吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.98,0:02:33.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就只有那一只啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.90,0:02:42.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 肚子饿死了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.70,0:02:44.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,吃那么一点哪够啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.87,0:02:46.87,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,别说出来 越说越饿\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.04,0:02:50.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这种时候来聊聊梦想吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.08,0:02:54.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就是将来想变成什么样\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.71,0:02:56.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么？搞不懂！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.05,0:02:58.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,总之我啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.17,0:03:00.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,想吃好吃的吃到撑！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.26,0:03:02.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真像阿始的风格\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.18,0:03:04.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那布比呢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.76,0:03:07.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我将来想结婚…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.10,0:03:09.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,结婚？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.60,0:03:11.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有个叫维罗妮卡的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.27,0:03:13.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可爱的女孩子\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.36,0:03:15.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 这个梦想很不错啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.65,0:03:16.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯嗯\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.73,0:03:17.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,里奇呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.82,0:03:21.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我要成为一个驻村冒险者！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.45,0:03:22.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,驻村？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.07,0:03:25.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就是成为村子的一员\n在那里工作的冒险者\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.33,0:03:28.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么想成为那样啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.45,0:03:31.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我想要一个故乡\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.08,0:03:34.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是这种像垃圾堆一样的地方\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.00,0:03:36.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要有丰富的自然风光才好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.38,0:03:42.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,然后互相帮助 互相扶持\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.97,0:03:44.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,像我们这样\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.14,0:03:46.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就像是伙伴一样\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.06,0:03:48.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我想在村子里交上很多伙伴！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.22,0:03:50.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊 听起来很开心！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.56,0:03:55.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我是不太懂啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.81,0:04:32.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,原来是这样啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.14,0:04:35.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,所以这个小摊一定会生意兴隆\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.40,0:04:37.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,变成超级帅气的摊位！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.23,0:04:40.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗 好厉害！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.53,0:04:42.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,也得开始准备烤串了呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.03,0:04:44.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.29,0:04:55.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,谁来帮帮我\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.34,0:05:08.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,想尿尿\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.81,0:05:13.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这样就不会被发现了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.86,0:05:26.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好险啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.58,0:05:32.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那是？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.34,0:05:41.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始先生\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.09,0:05:44.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？这么早就起来了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.71,0:05:45.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,能占用你点时间吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.55,0:05:47.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我有些事情想问\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.39,0:05:50.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 问什么都行\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.14,0:05:53.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是关于莉露酱的事\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.85,0:05:58.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我看到她的手腕上\n有我从未见过的纹样在发光…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.11,0:06:02.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,关于古代人种的事情\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.48,0:06:04.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我不太清楚\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.90,0:06:07.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露酱是不是出什么事了？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.41,0:06:10.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不过她跟平时没什么两样啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.03,0:06:12.87,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,村长也下达了通知\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.08,0:06:14.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,说哪怕有一点点可疑的事情\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.91,0:06:16.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,都要报告才行\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.25,0:06:18.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,说不定\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.46,0:06:21.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这跟半夜魔兽会来的事有关…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.51,0:06:29.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露跟这场骚动\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.68,0:06:31.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,一点关系都没有\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.15,0:06:46.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始先生明知道最近骚动的原因\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.23,0:06:48.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就是莉露酱\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.49,0:06:50.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,却决意要隐瞒吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.95,0:06:54.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这件事\n如果被村里的人知道了的话…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.58,0:06:56.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.70,0:06:59.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你居然把惹麻烦的家伙赶了出去\n真是了不起啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.58,0:07:00.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,干得好啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.33,0:07:04.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸你真冷血！跟他们好好相处啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.80,0:07:07.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可是 老鼠是有害的动物啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.05,0:07:11.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,早上好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.22,0:07:13.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,东云先生在吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.76,0:07:15.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,奥莉芙小姐 那个…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.77,0:07:19.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你找阿始的话 他还在睡哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.56,0:07:21.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 也是哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.60,0:07:24.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,晚上的工作很辛苦吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.15,0:07:29.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 目前正在调查原因\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.94,0:07:30.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.20,0:07:32.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.74,0:07:33.87,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.95,0:07:35.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你们是在准备祭典吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.62,0:07:36.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,加油哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.54,0:07:38.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,希望姐姐也能\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.58,0:07:41.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,到莉露的小摊来吃东西！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.71,0:07:44.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好 我很期待哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.01,0:07:50.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那我下次再来\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.05,0:07:54.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那个 你找始先生是有什么事吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.39,0:07:57.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我想他最近是不是有什么烦恼\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.35,0:07:59.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,因为东云先生一直以来\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.06,0:08:01.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,为我们背负了很多东西\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.19,0:08:04.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,受了他那么多照顾\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.81,0:08:06.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也想回报给他点什么\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.19,0:08:09.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,失去手臂那件事也是\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.94,0:08:12.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,他明明可以再多对我们发发火的…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.86,0:08:16.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,他可能没有意识到\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.32,0:08:18.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但他真的温柔过头了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.46,0:08:25.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那个 奥莉芙小姐\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.67,0:08:26.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.25,0:08:30.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,看招！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.76,0:08:40.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,给我适可而止！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.23,0:08:45.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是因为明天就是满月的日子了吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.98,0:08:47.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,魔兽的数量变多了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.86,0:08:56.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,还更加凶暴了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.12,0:08:58.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 没完没了的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.34,0:09:09.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始先生\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.55,0:09:16.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不和我们商量？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.01,0:09:19.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你难道觉得我们会抛弃莉露酱吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.93,0:09:21.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我就这么不值得信任吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.31,0:09:24.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,确实东云先生的手臂出事的时候…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.06,0:09:26.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好痛！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.14,0:09:28.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要是莉露酱出了什么问题\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.40,0:09:30.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,首先就该跟我商量 你这个笨蛋！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.23,0:09:33.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你从以前就喜欢独断专行\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.36,0:09:36.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但你现在带着个小孩\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.20,0:09:37.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就该成熟点啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.95,0:09:40.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你 你在说什么啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.12,0:09:41.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.41,0:09:42.49,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露酱的事情\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.79,0:09:44.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经告诉村子里的人了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.63,0:09:53.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,然后 大家一起做出了决定\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.51,0:09:59.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露酱\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.72,0:10:01.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就由全村的人一起来保护！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.64,0:10:07.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,古代人种在年幼时\n力量失控是常有的事情\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.31,0:10:09.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等那个时期过去了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.40,0:10:11.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,似乎自然就会稳定下来哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.90,0:10:12.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.40,0:10:16.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,总之 先熬过今天这个满月的日子\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.70,0:10:17.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这样一来\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.86,0:10:20.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,短时间内力量应该不会再次失控了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.95,0:10:23.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天是鹿神祭的日子\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.83,0:10:25.12,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,为了莉露酱\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.20,0:10:27.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,还有其他孩子们\n能够在祭典上玩得开心\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.71,0:10:30.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我们全村一起加油干吧 阿始！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.63,0:10:34.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就像我们这样…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.92,0:10:36.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,像伙伴一样\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.84,0:10:38.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我想在村子里交上很多伙伴！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.81,0:10:47.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 天亮了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.06,0:10:49.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,差不多该…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.44,0:10:56.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.07,0:11:02.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（29岁单身中坚冒险者的日常）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.05,0:11:18.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露不见了？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.80,0:11:21.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也一起找！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.68,0:11:22.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.84,0:11:23.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.01,0:11:27.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩能帮我们看着小摊吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.60,0:11:29.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.14,0:11:30.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,没有莉露在的话\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.73,0:11:32.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,祭典一点意思都没有！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.15,0:11:34.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露酱的话\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.31,0:11:35.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始先生一定会把她找回来的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.65,0:11:38.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,他可是驻村冒险者啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.15,0:11:40.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但是…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.65,0:11:43.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,而且 如果小摊上不热闹的话\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.57,0:11:45.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等莉露酱回来了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.37,0:11:46.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,她会觉得孤单的吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.50,0:11:52.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我明白了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.50,0:11:54.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可可\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.64,0:12:09.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.18,0:12:12.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 她跑到村子外面去了吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.65,0:12:15.02,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,到底该怎么办？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.05,0:12:49.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我要第一个到达祭典会场！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.73,0:12:54.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是驻村冒险者家的孩子？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.73,0:12:56.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 应该没错\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.40,0:13:00.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,受到莉露酱的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.73,0:13:02.49,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,古代人种力量影响\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.03,0:13:04.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天可能从白天开始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.57,0:13:06.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就会有魔兽聚集过来\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.28,0:13:12.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道大家每晚\n应对魔兽入侵已经很辛苦了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.16,0:13:14.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但还是希望大家\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.37,0:13:16.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,白天也能协助做好警备工作\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.63,0:13:24.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,每天晚上村子都…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.51,0:13:27.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始那么辛苦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.93,0:13:29.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,都是因为莉露吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.06,0:13:31.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,晚上的工作很辛苦吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.47,0:13:35.69,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 目前还在调查原因\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.73,0:13:39.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐说了\n从白天开始就会有魔兽来\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.69,0:13:41.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,如果魔兽来了村子\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.27,0:13:44.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,祭典就会被搞得乱七八糟的…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.61,0:13:47.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露不能待在村子里了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.37,0:13:56.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿尼扬酱 可可 对不起…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.62,0:13:58.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我没法跟你们一起摆摊了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.50,0:14:00.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,如果莉露在的话\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.92,0:14:03.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,会给大家添麻烦的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.24,0:14:34.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.89,0:15:01.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好痛…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.46,0:15:22.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,还没结束！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.59,0:15:25.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.30,0:15:28.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,冒险者绝对不会放弃的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.68,0:15:36.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,龙龙？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.08,0:15:56.12,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大家…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.42,0:16:10.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你这个笨蛋 净给我添麻烦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.88,0:16:12.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,再多依赖我一点啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.26,0:16:15.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我们难道不是伙伴吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.01,0:16:20.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你要做我的伙伴 就别哭！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.35,0:16:23.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.65,0:16:27.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露 你想怎么做？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.36,0:16:29.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.11,0:16:33.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露想跟阿始 还有村子里的大家\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.86,0:16:36.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,一起参加祭典！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.20,0:16:39.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你要做我的伙伴的话 就别哭\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.42,0:16:48.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.13,0:16:51.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,辛苦了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.76,0:16:55.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,月亮开始残缺了 应该已经没事了吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.34,0:16:59.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 好困\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.06,0:17:01.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我可是熬了一整夜啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.14,0:17:03.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.02,0:17:06.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,祭典还在办吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.02,0:17:08.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 别担心\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.36,0:17:12.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我们回村子去吧 大家都在等着呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.20,0:17:15.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.91,0:17:18.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,来 快点！抓紧时间！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.87,0:17:21.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 喂 别拉我！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.70,0:17:24.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,慢走\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.25,0:17:25.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,慢走！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.10,0:17:43.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿尼扬酱 可可\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.39,0:17:46.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 我来晚了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.86,0:17:54.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你好慢啊 莉露！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.53,0:17:59.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,噢！看起来好好吃！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.62,0:18:04.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,剩下的就交给你了哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.33,0:18:07.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,来 莉露 来烤吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.92,0:18:10.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都在等着吃你的烤串呢！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.09,0:18:15.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,能给我来一串吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.09,0:18:17.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我等了好久啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.55,0:18:19.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也要！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.51,0:18:21.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露酱 我也想吃\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.15,0:18:31.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎光临\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.89,0:19:02.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大家！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.89,0:19:04.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（鹿神祭引导人 鹿丸君）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.43,0:19:05.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是鹿丸君！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.60,0:19:10.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢大家 跳得这么起劲！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.10,0:19:13.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大家的能量 我收到啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.27,0:19:15.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,祝愿明年大家也能\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.03,0:19:18.74,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,吃得饱饱的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.95,0:20:09.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今年真是发生了好多事啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.85,0:20:30.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,据说这叫幸运星\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.56,0:20:32.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是会在祭典最后落下来的哦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.11,0:20:42.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始的份我也一起带去！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.62,0:20:50.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我是不太懂啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.33,0:20:55.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,像是什么故乡啊 很多伙伴啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.63,0:20:58.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我有你们就足够了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.30,0:21:05.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢！你们也是我最重要的人！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.43,0:21:08.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那么 我们三个一起去吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.85,0:21:12.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大家一起在故乡成为驻村冒险者吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.52,0:21:15.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,肯定每天都过得很开心！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.61,0:21:26.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好痛！谁啊 混账！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.79,0:21:36.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,-椅子\n-是\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.08,0:21:39.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,-非常感谢\n-喂 莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.79,0:21:40.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.21,0:21:43.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你每天过得开心吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.55,0:21:49.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯！特别开心！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.27,0:23:18.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,一路平安！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.98,0:23:20.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好嘞\n
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.56,0:23:23.82,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露 我们走\n
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.28,0:23:29.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！出发啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.53,0:23:35.74,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那今天也悠闲地\n
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.08,0:23:38.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,开始工作吧\n
